      },
      {
        "text": "The absence of a central coordinator for outreach to social media companies compromises protection against foreign interference.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "21st-century warfare includes misinformation, disinformation, and cyber operations.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There are more than a dozen Chinese tech companies valued over $10 billion.",
