    "turn_idx": 122,
    "turn_text": "That to me is one of the questions that make this investigation so terribly important. The president's unwillingness to acknowledge Russian intervention and take actions against it. I don't have a good explanation. It is one of the reasons why there are so many that speculate and why it appears Mr. Mueller's investigation continues to pick up speed that there were so many such an unusually high number of contacts between senior Russian officials and individuals that were affiliated with the Trump campaign, whether it was with outreach to General Flynn, who's been indicted, outreach to George Papadopoulos, who's pled guilty,",
